<title>USA: Micron begins tender offer for Netframe.</title>
<headline>Micron begins tender offer for Netframe.</headline>
<dateline>NAMPA, Idaho 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Micron Electronics Inc's Payette Acquisition Corp unit Monday began an all-cash tender offer for NetFRAME Systems Inc at a price of $1 per share.</p>
<p>The offer and withdrawal rights will expire July 14, unless extended.</p>
<p>On June 10, Micron, the computer maker majority-owned by semiconductor giant Micron Technology Inc, announced it would acquire Netframe for about $14 million.</p>
</text>
